sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant API as 业务服务
  participant DB as MySQL
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant AC as 审计消费者

  API->>DB: BEGIN 业务事务
  API->>DB: 写业务表
  API->>DB: INSERT edu_audit_log + edu_audit_change（同事务）
  API->>DB: COMMIT
  alt 日志写入失败
    API->>MQ: edu.audit.compensate
    MQ->>AC: 补偿写入
    alt 持续失败
      AC->>API: 触发只读降级（AUD-Q-05）
    end
  end
